BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c9bd0b9f-561d-3135-a10f-4b8c9ac4e17a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
